  "body_html": "<p>Embrace rustic elegance with this charming Jeminise farmhouse quilt set, perfect for adding a cozy, timeless look to any bedroom. Featuring classic patterns, it's an ideal gift to bring warmth and tradition to your loved ones.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Rustic Elegance:</strong> Designed with farmhouse charm, this quilt features classic patterns and soft fabrics for a cozy, traditional aesthetic.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An absolutely perfect gift for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for family members like mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, or daughter.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> This farmhouse quilt is available in multiple sizes, including Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86''), Full (80\"x90''), Queen (90\"x90''), and King (102\"x91'').</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization Options:</strong> Personalize your quilt by selecting your desired size, adding pillowcases, or including a custom name.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each set includes 1 quilt, with the option to add 2 pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This microfiber quilt is machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat for fluffier results.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from polycotton fabric for comfort and durability.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Patchwork Style Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Farmhouse Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
